# greatest common divisor by Euclid: a b -> gcd
program {
label { gcd }
store { b }
store { a }
label { gcd_loop }
b x=0?
goto { gcd_done }
drop
a b mod
b store { a }
store { b }
goto { gcd_loop }
label { gcd_done }
drop
a
return
}
48 18 xeq { gcd }
17 5 xeq { gcd }
100 75 xeq { gcd }
7 0 xeq { gcd }
1071 462 xeq { gcd }
* p
